; Dusk Gym - slow, vast dragon-tower theme in F# minor. Original composition, CC0-1.0.
#title Dragon Spire
#tempo 72
#time 4/4
#key F# minor
#inst 1 duty=1 env=12,-1 rel=-3 vib=30,20,4
#inst 2 duty=2 env=8,-2 rel=-2
#inst 3 wave=4 env=13,0
#def Ar o3 c4. g4. > c4 <
#def Dn o2 c1
#def Dr T4 r4 r4 U8 U8

A @1 o4 $ f+2. a4 | > d2 c+4 < b4 | a2. e4 | g+4 b4 > e2 < | f+4. g+8 a4 > c+4 < | > d2. < b4 | c+4 e4 g+4 > c+4 < | > d2 < a4 f+4 | b2 > d4 f+4 < | > d4. c+8 < b4 a4 | g+2 e4 c+4 | f+1 |
B @2 $ k6{Ar} | k2{Ar} | k9{Ar} | k4{Ar} | k6{Ar} | k11{Ar} | k1{Ar} | k2{Ar} | k11{Ar} | k2{Ar} | k1{Ar} | k6{Ar} | k0
C @3 $ k6{Dn} | k2{Dn} | k9{Dn} | k4{Dn} | k6{Dn} | k11{Dn} | k1{Dn} | k2{Dn} | k11{Dn} | k2{Dn} | k1{Dn} | k6{Dn} | k0
D v10 $ C4 r4 r4 U8 U8 [{Dr}]11
